{"id":"themed-spaces","title":"Themed Spaces","url":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/Themed_Spaces","rev":237069,"fetched":"2026-10-16","lead":[{"t":"p","c":[{"t":"b","c":["Themed Spaces"]}," was a very prevalent architectural design from the late 1980s to the mid-2000s. It was often incorporated in playgrounds, retro fast food joints, kitschy-wacky postmodernist objects or TV sets, along with its decorative elements that incorporate the foundation of bright primary colors (blue, yellow, red), candy-like rounded striped columns and large geometric shapes where this design style often focuses on expressive, bright, maximalist, and forms a very dramatic appearance."]}],"sections":[{"title":"Visuals","id":"visuals","blocks":[{"t":"p","c":["The aesthetic for every individualized room is created to embody the sense of being inside a luxurious space capsule which offers spaces that mix and Studio Ghibli-inspired and whimsy fairy-tale with warm boho style decor where the spaces are accented with glowing, artificial climbing plants, soft lamps (fairy lights) in the ceiling, celestial elements such as moon-shaped ornaments, and constellation paintings, along with cozy cotton knit textures, inspired by the Italian coast, and traditional Greek design. This aesthetic incorporates concealed luxury (quiet glamour), the use of natural materials, and tranquility, along with important details that include rustic wood-beamed ceilings, textured concrete walls, minimal furniture in earthy tones, and arched hallways."]},{"t":"p","c":["This architecture style mixes intimate comfort and midcentury airbrush-futuristic surrealism fantasy, ",{"t":"a","c":["Utopian Scholastic"],"id":"utopian-scholastic"}," / ",{"t":"a","c":["Deco-Luxe"],"href":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/Deco-Luxe"}," / ",{"t":"a","c":["Wacky Pomo"],"id":"wacky-pomo"}," appearance with elements incorporate curved sofas, overhead lighting and a color palette of dark tones such as deep purples and browns, replicating galaxies, scattered stars."]}]},{"title":"Gallery","id":"gallery","blocks":[{"t":"gallery","items":[{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/d/d8/EyJidWNrZXQiOiJhcmVuYV9pbWFnZXMiLCJrZXkiOiIxODgwNDQ1MS9vcmlnaW5hbF8wMjU5OGIwYWM3MjMzMmJiYTQ4YTE4YjU1Mzc2Mm...9LCJmbGF0dGVuIjp7ImJhY2tncm91bmQiOnsiciI6MjAzLCJnIjoyMDMsImIiOjIwM319LCJqcGVnIjp7InF1YWxpdHkiOjc1fSwicm90YXRlIjpudWxsfX0%3D.webp/revision/latest?cb=20260907052853","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/e/e8/EyJidWNrZXQiOiJhcmVuYV9pbWFnZXMiLCJrZXkiOiIyNjA4NTc1Ny9vcmlnaW5hbF84OGQ5YTE2OTg2ZGQ0MjU5NTdiYjlkZWM2ZTMwOT...9LCJmbGF0dGVuIjp7ImJhY2tncm91bmQiOnsiciI6MjAzLCJnIjoyMDMsImIiOjIwM319LCJqcGVnIjp7InF1YWxpdHkiOjc1fSwicm90YXRlIjpudWxsfX0%3D.webp/revision/latest?cb=20260907052830","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/8/8a/EyJidWNrZXQiOiJhcmVuYV9pbWFnZXMiLCJrZXkiOiIzNzMwNjcwNC9vcmlnaW5hbF9kYWMwZDBjNWEwZGIzYzBiMDQ5Mzk2OGE2OGY5Mz...9LCJmbGF0dGVuIjp7ImJhY2tncm91bmQiOnsiciI6MjAzLCJnIjoyMDMsImIiOjIwM319LCJqcGVnIjp7InF1YWxpdHkiOjc1fSwicm90YXRlIjpudWxsfX0%3D.webp/revision/latest?cb=20260907052453","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/7/71/EyJidWNrZXQiOiJhcmVuYV9pbWFnZXMiLCJrZXkiOiIzNzMwNjYzNS9vcmlnaW5hbF80NDkxNDljN2QzNTg4MjI0Mjg2MzcyNWZmOGMxNj...9LCJmbGF0dGVuIjp7ImJhY2tncm91bmQiOnsiciI6MjAzLCJnIjoyMDMsImIiOjIwM319LCJqcGVnIjp7InF1YWxpdHkiOjc1fSwicm90YXRlIjpudWxsfX0%3D.webp/revision/latest?cb=20260907052420","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/e/e2/EyJidWNrZXQiOiJhcmVuYV9pbWFnZXMiLCJrZXkiOiIyNjA4NjE4MS9vcmlnaW5hbF85ZDhhNWM4Y2ZmYzAzYmViZGM2ZmIzYjY4NTgxZm...9LCJmbGF0dGVuIjp7ImJhY2tncm91bmQiOnsiciI6MjAzLCJnIjoyMDMsImIiOjIwM319LCJqcGVnIjp7InF1YWxpdHkiOjc1fSwicm90YXRlIjpudWxsfX0%3D.webp/revision/latest?cb=20260907052357","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/f/f4/EyJidWNrZXQiOiJhcmVuYV9pbWFnZXMiLCJrZXkiOiIyNjA4NjE3OS9vcml